<title>UK: LIFFE coffee below new peak, still above $2,000.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee below new peak, still above $2,000.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Propels to 15-1/2-month high of $2,060 basis July before finishing midday at $2,034, still $101 up.</p>
<p>COCOA - Opens higher and hold gains on a mixed of short-covering and new longs. NY seen up. July up 11 stg at 1,029</p>
<p>SUGAR - Touch weaker in tight ranges. Aug off 40 cents at $317.60 at 1132 GMT.</p>
</text>
